    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3: 系统函数的应用",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            145,
            83,
            410,
            106
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、求解系统方程 $H(s)=\\frac{R_{zs}(s)}{E(s)}=\\frac{右边形式}{左边形式}$",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            114,
            500,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、求解系统的冲激响应： $H(s)\\xrightarrow{\\text{逆变换}}h(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            151,
            550,
            186
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {g ^ {\\prime} (t)} & {= h (t)} \\\\ {S G (s) - g (0, t)} & {= 0 = H (s)} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow S G (s) = H (s)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            651,
            73,
            936,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、求解系统的阶跃响应: $G(s) = \\frac{H(s)}{s} \\xrightarrow{\\text{逆变换}} g(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            135,
            187,
            604,
            228
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、求解系统的零状态响应： $R_{zs}(s)=H(s)\\cdot E(s)\\xrightarrow{逆变换}r_{zs}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            138,
            227,
            681,
            265
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 18: 已知微分方程 $r''(t) + 3r'(t) + 2r(t) = e'(t) + 3e(t)$ ， $e(t) = e^{-4t}u(t)$ ，求 $h(t)$ 、 $g(t)$ 、",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            283,
            849,
            313
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$r_{zs}(t)$ 。 $y: H(S)=\\frac{8+3}{S^{2}+3S+2}=\\frac{8+3}{(S+1)(S+2)}=\\frac{2}{S+1}+\\frac{-1}{S+2}\\Rightarrow h(H)=\\left(2e^{-t}-e^{-2t}\\right)(H(t))$",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            310,
            978,
            354
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {2} S (S) = E (S) \\cdot H (S) = \\frac {S + 3}{(S + 1) (S + 2) (S + 4)} = \\frac {\\frac {2}{3}}{S + 1} + \\frac {- \\frac {1}{2}}{S + 2} + \\frac {- \\frac {1}{6}}{S + 4} \\Rightarrow R _ {2} (H) = (\\frac {2}{3} e ^ {- b} - \\frac {1}{2} e ^ {- 2 a} - \\frac {1}{6} e ^ {4 a}) (W)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            230,
            376,
            998,
            428
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、求解系统某一特征值的复频域响应",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            476,
            486,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若输入为 $e^{s_0t}$ ，则对应输出为 $H(s_0)e^{s_0t}$ 【要求 $s_0$ 在ROC内， $s_0$ 为复常数】，",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            502,
            781,
            527
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "当 $s_0 = 0$ 时，输入为直流信号 $E = E \\cdot e^{0 \\cdot t}$ (E看为系数)，则对应的输出",
        "bbox": [
            148,
            535,
            746,
            557
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nE \\cdot H (0) \\cdot e ^ {0 \\cdot t} = E \\cdot H (0)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            148,
            567,
            339,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
