        "type": "text",
        "text": "条件: 税定式化, 拨入 u(t) 或有方的支 $\\begin{cases}\\cos w o t / \\sin w o t \\xrightarrow{\\text{(反热)}} \\text{输出[也可以硬叫税态]} \\\\ \\cos w o t \\xrightarrow{\\text{(受热)}} \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \\text{输出} e^{\\text{折变}} + [ \\downarrow] \\text{u(t)} \\\\ \\text{标志} y_{\\text{eff}} = [ \\downarrow] \\text{u(t)}\\end{array} \\right. \\\\ u(t) \\to \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} \\text{输入(互换反)} \\\\ \\text{税志} = \\text{常否} u(t)\\end{array} \\right.\\end{cases}$",
